  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this particular programme UNAIDS is taking a more comprehensive and strategic regional approach to the HIV prevention agenda. Sida has taken a very active part in the development of this programme where UNAIDS actually is taking the lead role regionally to build capacity and to advocate for scaling up on the agenda for preventive programmes.</narrative>
